# Week 5. Local memory stores. The deployed service uses Postgres; these are
# the SQLite fallback used on a laptop and by the tests, and they hold whatever
# a developer happened to audit. Committing one would make a stale, personal
# store look like part of the project.
*.db

# NOT ignored: memory-demo.jsonl. That is the recorded before/after evidence and
# it is committed for the same reason week 4 commits traces.jsonl — a claim about
# how many lookups memory saved should be checkable against the runs it came
# from, by someone who was not here.
#
# Scratch runs made while developing are a different thing.
smoke.jsonl
